    intro: "If humans are made in God's image, why do they do such terrible things? Why are there murders, lies and cruelty? The Bible's answer is that something went wrong. Humans rebelled against God, and the image has been marred. We still bear it, but we reflect it poorly, like a cracked mirror.",
